{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52423","headline":"回波乐 六十六 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 六十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"断诸恶，细细詃（项校「去」）贪嗔。\n若使如罗汉，即自绝嚣尘。\n将刀且割无明暗，复用利剑断亲姻。\n究竟湼盘非是远，寻思寂灭即爲邻。\n只是衆生不牵致，所以沉沦罪业深。\n努力努力遵三宝，[何]愁何虑不全身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52423.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52423","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}